('Fernando Poe', 'fernando.p@email.com', 1, 'Absolutely the worst dining experience. Cold food, rude waiter, and they overcharged us. Never again.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Miriam Defensor', 'miriam.d@email.com', 2, 'The pizza was burnt on the edges and raw in the middle. How do you mess that up? Unacceptable.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Corazon Santiago', 'corazon.s@email.com', 1, 'The restroom was filthy and there was no soap. If they can''t keep the bathroom clean, imagine the kitchen.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Fidel Ramos', 'fidel.r@email.com', 2, 'Overpriced and underwhelming. The fried chicken was tiny and the sides were pathetic. Such a letdown.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Gloria Arroyo', 'gloria.ar@email.com', 1, 'We waited 50 minutes for TWO pizzas. When they arrived, one was wrong. Staff didn''t care. Horrible.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Rodrigo Roa', 'rodrigo.r@email.com', 2, 'The air conditioning was broken. Eating hot pizza in a sweltering restaurant is not a pleasant experience.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Benigno Simeon', 'benigno.s@email.com', 1, 'Cockroach crawling on the wall next to our table. We left immediately. Disgusting and unsanitary.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Joseph Estrada', 'joseph.e@email.com', 2, 'The delivery driver was 40 minutes late and didn''t even apologize. Pizza was stone cold.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Manuel Quezon', 'manuel.q@email.com', 1, 'The spaghetti tasted like cafeteria food. Watery sauce, mushy noodles, and barely any meat. Terrible.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Sergio Osmena', 'sergio.o@email.com', 2, 'Stale bread and the dipping sauce had an off taste. Not what I expected from the online reviews.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Elpidio Quirino', 'elpidio.q@email.com', 1, 'They charged me for items I didn''t order and the manager refused to fix the bill. Dishonest practices.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Carlos Garcia Jr', 'carlos.gj@email.com', 2, 'The toppings were not fresh. The vegetables looked like they''d been sitting out all day. Very disappointing.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Diosdado Macapagal', 'diosdado.m@email.com', 1, 'Found a plastic piece in my fried chicken. Could have choked. This is dangerous and negligent.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Ferdinand Marcos', 'ferdinand.m@email.com', 2, 'The pizza box was soaked with grease. Disgusting presentation. The pizza itself was mediocre at best.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Emilio Jacinto', 'emilio.j@email.com', 1, 'The worst customer service ever. Staff was on their phones instead of taking orders. Had to yell to get attention.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
('Andres Bonifacio', 'andres.b@email.com', 2, 'Bland, tasteless pizza. Zero seasoning. Even the cheese tasted like nothing. Such a waste.', 'negative', true, now() - interval '1 day' * floor(random() * 60)),
